-line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I’m constantly involved in activities that require the use of both my iPhone and my Windows PC, and being able to share the clipboard and files between both devices is a must for me. For months I settled with just using Notes and Files through iCloud web to copy paste what I needed, but this process was just way more tedious and annoying than it needed to be. Now, all I have to do is open LocalSend on both devices, and voila - my clipboard is shared easily and instantly. The app works with VPNs running on both devices as well (so long as local network sharing is enabled) which makes this app nearly perfect in my eyes. I would love to see some sort of widget that allows for even easier sharing between devices directly from my iPhone home screen, but that is by no means a necessity in my eyes. I rarely leave reviews but have been very pleased with this app over the last several months and wanted to give the developers their flowers. Keep up the fantastic work!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  </div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">LocalSend saved my sanity…</h1> </div> <div class="content-containe