tter during migration.\n\n● Backup & Restore Messages and Call History\nCreate a secure backup of your messages and call history. Restore them anytime when switching phones, upgrading devices, or recovering important data.\n\n● iCloud to New Device\nSign in with your Apple ID and restore photos, videos, contacts, documents, and other important data from iCloud directly to your new device.\n\nWhy Choose MobileTrans?\n● Fast Phone Transfer\nTransfer up to 200× faster than Bluetooth. With an average speed of 30 MB/s, you can move a 1 GB video in about 30 seconds.\n\n● No Mobile Data Required\nMobileTrans uses a direct local connection between devices, so your mobile data plan won't be used during the transfer.\n\n● QR Code Connection\nConnect your old and new phones instantly by scanning a QR code. Enjoy a wireless connection with no cables, complicated setup, or computer required. Move data with a quick share experience while keeping security.\n\n● High Privacy & Data Security\nYour data stays on your devices throughout the transfer process. MobileTrans does not store or upload your personal information, helping keep your data private and secure.\n\nSubscribe to get unlimited access to all features:\n- Phone Transfer\n- File Transfer\n- Photo Transfer\n- WhatsApp Transfer\n- Contact & App Transfer\n- iCloud Transfer\n- Phone-to-PC Transfer\n\nSubscription Terms:\nPayment will be charged to your iTunes Account at purchase. \nSubscription renews automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. \nManage or turn off auto-renew in Account Settings anytime after purchase.\n\nAbout the Developer-Wondershare \nWith more than one million users in more than 120 countries and regions around the world, Wondershare is a company dedicated to creative software.\n\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nContact: customer_service@wondershare.com","rating":3.9,"ratingCount":"1.1K","buttonAct