st a few taps.\nMobileTrans makes switching phones simple, even across different operating systems. Securely move your photos, videos, contacts, files, apps, and WhatsApp chats to your new device without losing important data. Need more than phone-to-phone transfer? MobileTrans also helps you restore data from iCloud, create backups before switching, and move files between your phone and computer.\n\nWith the new AI Transfer feature, MobileTrans can identify large files, old files, damaged files, and duplicate contacts before you switch phones, helping you decide what to move first.\n\nEverything You Need for Phone Transfer\n● Phone Data Transfer\nSwitch between different platforms and move your data to a new phone. MobileTrans supports all major data types, including photos, videos, WhatsApp data, audio files, contacts, music, documents, and more. MobileTrans helps you clone apps and move important data.\n\n● WhatsApp Transfer\nMove your WhatsApp messages and chats to a new phone securely, including chat history, photos, videos, contacts, stickers, and other attachments. Keep your chat history intact and continue conversations seamlessly on your new device.\n\n● AI Transfer\nKnow what matters before you transfer. AI Transfer helps identify large files, old files, damaged files, and duplicate contacts on your phone. This makes phone switching more efficient and helps reduce clutter during migration.\n\n● Backup & Restore Messages and Call History\nCreate a secure backup of your messages and call history. Restore them anytime when switching phones, upgrading devices, or recovering important data.\n\n● iCloud to New Device\nSign in with your Apple ID and restore photos, videos, contacts, documents, and other important data from iCloud directly to your new device.\n\nWhy Choose MobileTrans?\n● Fast Phone Transfer\nTransfer up to 200× faster than Bluetooth. With an average speed of 30 MB/s, you can move a 1 GB video in about 30 seconds.\n\n● No Mobile Data Required\nMob