the picture resolution, 【Batch】\n  • Compress to the specified size - One-click compression to the specified size, 【Batch】\n  • Convert LivePhoto to MP4, 【Batch】\n\n● GIF  【Support Estimation Using AI】\n  • Video to GIF - Small, fast and better GIF conversion engine\n  • GIF to MP4 - 【Batch】\n  • Convert LivePhoto to GIF\n\n● Video\n  • Convert to MP4 - Convert ALL video formats to MP4, 【Batch】\n    (Detailed supported formats: WEBM, AVI, WMV, MPEG, MP4, M4V, MOV, FLV, F4V, RMVB, 3GP, TS, M4S...)\n  • Compression - Does not change the video quality, only modifies the video resolution, 【Batch】\n  • Compress to a specified size - Compress to a specified size-compress the video to a specified size, preserve the video quality to the utmost extent, modify the video resolution at the same time, and whether to retain the audio\n  • Photo extraction\n  • Audio extraction\n\n● Audio\n  • Format conversion - Support All audio formats, 【Batch】\n    (Detailed supported formats: AAC, OGG, M4A, WAV, FLAC, MP3, AIFF, MID, WMA, CAF, AMR, AC3, TS, OPUS...)\n  • Trim\n  • Concat\n\n● PDF\n  • Convert to PDF - Convert images to PDF, 【Batch】\n\n● Unzip/Compression\n  • Unzip - Support zip and 7z. Support compressed files with password protection\n  • Compression - Compress and package multiple media or files, and support password setting. Support zip and 7z.\n\nAll tools support selecting source materials from [Photo] or [File].\n\nWe know that thinking from the perspective of users can better serve users. We want to make the most of every commonly used function. Smaller, faster, better, great performance, lower power consumption.\n\nWe understand the importance of privacy and take personal privacy very seriously. All our processing runs locally and does not upload to the background.\n\nThank you to everyone who supports us. If you like [Toolbox], please leave a good comment to support us. If you have new needs, ideas or any questions, you can talk with us at any time.\nEmail: support@